  "description": "“Are you Eungwang’s older sister?” \n\nThat was the first thing people said whenever they met Eunsung. Eunsung, Eungwang’s older sister. To everyone else, that was all Jung Eunsung was. Until Suhyeok called her by her own name. \n\n“You’re Jung Eunsung, right? Jung Eunsung from Class 3-3.” \n\nEleven years later, Eunsung has become an economics reporter for Shinil Daily. \n\n“Oppa’s here, Eunsung.” \n\nWhen a senior reporter’s unwanted advances put her in an uncomfortable situation, it was Suhyeok who saved her. \n\n“Cha Suhyeok. Do you want to sleep with me?” \n\n“Cha Suhyeok. What are we?” \n\n“Let’s not be old-fashioned and ask about every little thing.” “Don’t do it with anyone else. Only sleep with me.” \n\nSuhyeok believes Eunsung is a cool, carefree woman, while Eunsung only pretends to be strong because she doesn’t want to look pathetic or foolish. Between the two of them, absurd misunderstandings begin to pile up. An overly pure yet blatantly erotic first-love story full of mutual missteps: Eungwang’s Older Sister, Eunsung.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4921002515)",
